Author: Collie Kart project (based on CTRPluginFramework Blank Template)

Version:
    Major: 0
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 12

Targets:

Title: Collie Kart Portable P006.4

Summary: Four independent bounded control tests on MK7 USA Rev 2

Description: |
    P006.4 extends the validated P006.3b native A input hook
    into one-shot tests: throttle (18 frames), left/right analog
    steering with A (36 frames each), and B reverse (90 frames).
    A completed dry run, physical B abort rehearsal and normal
    pass-through callback counts are required. One attempt per
    action per session. Original input and human override have
    priority. No AI training or unattended driving implemented.
    Steering and reversing are unverified on 3DS hardware.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
